  "title": "Fury Engages Leading Firms to Advance Eau Claire Pre-Feasibility Study Work - Fury Gold Mines Limited",
  "summary": "TORONTO, Canada – June 9, 2026 – Fury Gold Mines Limited (TSX and NYSE American: FURY) (“Fury” or the “Company”) is pleased to announce it has engaged a team of technical consultants to lead the next phase of development for its Eau Claire Gold Project (“Eau Claire” the “Project), located in the Eeyou-Istchee/James Bay region of northern Quebec. This engagement […]",
